om a CACREP-accredited program or a doctorate in a related profession. Five years’ experience in counseling or a related position. Rider University is committed to fostering an inclusive, vibrant living and learning community that embraces students, faculty, and staff of all backgrounds and enables them to achieve success. Rider University is an Equal Opportunity Employer. This position is not eligible for benefits. Employer Rider University Address 2083 Lawrenceville Road Lawrenceville, New Jersey, 08648-3099 Phone 609-896-5000 Website https://www.rider.edu Apply"
